      "measurementSchema": "Tolerance of Ambiguity Scale administered alongside automated softener-density analysis (hedges, qualifiers, modal verbs per 100 words) on AI outputs. Gentle-Layer index = softener-density x participant tolerance-of-ambiguity score.",
      "exampleData": "{\"session_id\": \"S188\", \"participant\": \"P061\", \"softener_density_per_100w\": 4.8, \"tolerance_ambiguity_score\": 56, \"gentle_layer_index\": 2.69, \"harshness_preserved_pct\": 92}",
