      "name": "Motivation Fire",
      "description": "Ein aktivierender Impuls, der Handlungsenergie freisetzt, ohne zu überfordern. Kurz, klar, nach vorne gerichtet.",
      "inDefinedTermSet": "https://augmanitai.com/terms/",
      "termCode": "AUG-1020",
      "alternateName": "Motivations-Feuer",
      "inLanguage": "de",
      "about": "fun",
      "operationalDefinition": "Operational scope: an instance of 'Motivation Fire' is counted when the observable pattern described above (Ein aktivierender Impuls, der Handlungsenergie freisetzt, ohne zu überfordern. K...) occurs at least once within a defined interaction segment of N turns (typically N=10), as coded by trained raters.",
      "measurementSchema": "Self-report Likert (1-7) on perceived humor-loop strength after a session; complementary indicator: laughter-event count per minute.",
